Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 07:31:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Add RoboTwin stats tool and CPU dataloader smoke test

compute_robotwin_action_stats.py builds the dataset index cache and writes
exact per-dim q01/q99/mean/std/min/max of the action column (the keys
load_action_stats and the policy servers read). robotwin_dataset_smoke_test.py
loads the run TOML like training does, instantiates the configured dataset on
CPU and checks image layout, action window and conditioning row, padding,
sequence plan, prompt and normalization ranges.

